<br/>
Here's a breakdown of the case types, finishes, and pricing across the new Apple Watch lineup:<br/>
<br/>
<ul><li><strong>Apple Watch Series 12 (aluminum)</strong>: Available in space gray, black, light gold, and dark bronze (starts at &#36;399).</li><br/>
<li><strong>Apple Watch Series 12 (titanium)</strong>: Available in radiant gold and natural (starts at &#36;699).</li><br/>
<li><strong>Apple Watch Series 12 (ceramic)</strong>: Available in pearl white and night blue (starts at &#36;899).</li><br/>
<li><strong>Apple Watch Ultra 4 (titanium)</strong>: Available in natural and black finishes (starts at &#36;799).</li><br/>
<li><strong>Apple Watch Hermès Series 12 (titanium)</strong>: Available in radiant gold and silver (starts at &#36;1,399).</li> <li><strong>Apple Watch Hermès Ultra 4 (titanium)</strong>: Available in natural titanium (starts at &#36;1,499).</li> </ul><br/>
<br/>
